{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/ca/e7/157816_crt_OX5wK.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/ca/e7/157816_crt_OX5wK.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/ca/e7/157816_crt_OX5wK.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/ca/e7/157816_crt_OX5wK.jpg"},"name":"ララ","summary":"かつて地上に憧れて人間の王子と恋をしたが、成就せずに泡となって消えた人魚姫。約200年の時を超えて滋賀県・琵琶湖に人間として蘇り、もう一度本当の愛を探す。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/9f/a8/44308_prsn_alah1.jpg?r=1730989851","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/9f/a8/44308_prsn_alah1.jpg?r=1730989851","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/9f/a8/44308_prsn_alah1.jpg?r=1730989851","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/9f/a8/44308_prsn_alah1.jpg?r=1730989851"},"name":"菱川花菜","short_summary":"プロ・フィット⇒ラクーンドッグ　所属\r\n\r\n出身地\t東京都\r\n趣味　絵を描く、ランニング\r\n特技　絵を描く、ビビンバを混ぜる\r\n経歴　プロ・フィット声優養成所　卒","career":["seiyu"],"id":44308,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":157816},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/db/6d/157817_crt_8Z42S.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/db/6d/157817_crt_8Z42S.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/db/6d/157817_crt_8Z42S.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/db/6d/157817_crt_8Z42S.jpg"},"name":"大津茉里","summary":"滋賀県大津市に住む女子高生ボクサー。\r\n幼い頃に母を亡くし、祖母と父と兄と暮らしている。\r\n行くあてのないララと出会い、自宅に住まわせることに。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/6e/3e/80726_prsn_Q7uKG.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/6e/3e/80726_prsn_Q7uKG.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/6e/3e/80726_prsn_Q7uKG.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/6e/3e/80726_prsn_Q7uKG.jpg"},"name":"川石奈奈","short_summary":"出身地：滋賀県\r\n趣味：歌うこと、英会話\r\n特技：競技かるた、そろばん、ハンガリー語","career":["seiyu"],"id":80726,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":157817},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/5a/2c/203741_crt_7EyLy.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/5a/2c/203741_crt_7EyLy.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/5a/2c/203741_crt_7EyLy.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/5a/2c/203741_crt_7EyLy.jpg"},"name":"グレイス","summary":"ララを人間に変えた魔女。\r\n掟を嫌い、人魚の世界から追放された鼻つまみ者。\r\n現在は魚に姿を変え、なぜか茉里と一緒にいるようだが……","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/5e/b1/4141_seiyu_anidb.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/5e/b1/4141_seiyu_anidb.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/5e/b1/4141_seiyu_anidb.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/5e/b1/4141_seiyu_anidb.jpg"},"name":"深見梨加","short_summary":"","career":["artist","seiyu"],"id":4141,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":203741},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/6e/2d/203742_crt_Ne06r.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/6e/2d/203742_crt_Ne06r.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/6e/2d/203742_crt_Ne06r.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/6e/2d/203742_crt_Ne06r.jpg"},"name":"ルカ","summary":"ララが滋賀で出会う少年。\r\nその見た目は200年前にララが恋をした王子によく似ている。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/ee/d9/8253_prsn_5s7m7.jpg?r=1775328732","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/ee/d9/8253_prsn_5s7m7.jpg?r=1775328732","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/ee/d9/8253_prsn_5s7m7.jpg?r=1775328732","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/ee/d9/8253_prsn_5s7m7.jpg?r=1775328732"},"name":"村瀬歩","short_summary":"日本の男性声優。アメリカ合衆国出身。ヴィムス所属。\r\n\r\nアメリカで生まれた後、高校時代まで愛知県で過ごし、京都府の大学に進学後上京。\r\n芝居を観るのが好きだったことから声優を目指し、日本ナレーション演技研究所へ入所。2012年、『Persona4 the ANIMATION』で声優デビュー。同年、『新世界より』の青沼瞬（14歳）役で初のメインキャラクターを演じた。2014年、『ハイキュー!!』の日向翔陽役で初主演を果たした。\r\n2016年に、第10回声優アワードで新人男優賞を受賞した。\r\n\r\n尊敬する声優は、自身が声優を目指すきっかけとなった大友龍三郎や、年齢が近く共演も多い松岡禎丞。\r\n中性的な音質を生かした役を演じることが多く、女性のガヤに加わったり、『チア男子!!』では佐久間龍造役と姉3名の役も兼ねるなど、女性キャラクターを演じることもある。またラジオなどでも村瀬歩（あゆみ）という女子の設定で話すことがある。一方で、『M3〜ソノ黒キ鋼〜』の伊削ヘイト役のように狂気じみた低音ボイスもこなせるほど声域が非常に広い。\r\n帰国子女のため英会話が堪能で、英語を必要とするモブキャラやガヤもこなし、洋画の吹き替えも増えている。","career":["seiyu"],"id":8253,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":203742},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/84/33/208759_crt_9Yz2n.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/84/33/208759_crt_9Yz2n.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/84/33/208759_crt_9Yz2n.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/84/33/208759_crt_9Yz2n.jpg"},"name":"大津祥弥","summary":"茉里の兄。\r\n茉里と同じ高校に通う三年生。\r\n友達は多いが学校はサボり気味。\r\n趣味はバイク。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/86/8d/39597_prsn_MvSMl.jpg?r=1600507601","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/86/8d/39597_prsn_MvSMl.jpg?r=1600507601","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/86/8d/39597_prsn_MvSMl.jpg?r=1600507601","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/86/8d/39597_prsn_MvSMl.jpg?r=1600507601"},"name":"大野智敬","short_summary":"かつてはビットプロモーションに所属。2018年3月9日にビットプロモーションのプロダクション独立より設立されたブライドイデアに移籍。2019年3月31日を以ってブライトイデアを退所し、同年4月1日よりマウスプロモーションに移籍。","career":["seiyu"],"id":39597,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":208759},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/17/1b/208760_crt_BcqbB.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/17/1b/208760_crt_BcqbB.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/17/1b/208760_crt_BcqbB.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/17/1b/208760_crt_BcqbB.jpg"},"name":"大津誠","summary":"茉里の父親でフリーのカメラマン。口数は少ないが、茉里と祥弥、そしてララの成長を優しく見守る。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/77/16/4313_seiyu_anidb.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/77/16/4313_seiyu_anidb.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/77/16/4313_seiyu_anidb.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/77/16/4313_seiyu_anidb.jpg"},"name":"真殿光昭","short_summary":"","career":["seiyu"],"id":4313,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":208760},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/9d/cd/208761_crt_NkWYf.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/9d/cd/208761_crt_NkWYf.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/9d/cd/208